  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"notice metadata\" id=\"stub\" style=\"padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:10px\"><i>Warning: Key elements of this quest-related article are incomplete. You can help the Guild Wars Wiki by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//wiki.guildwars.com/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span> according to the <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Wiki:Formatting/Quests\" title=\"Guild Wars Wiki:Formatting/Quests\">formatting guide</a>.</i></div>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Student Sousuke\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Istan Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Field_General_Hayao\" title=\"Field General Hayao\">Field General Hayao</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Plains_of_Jarin\" title=\"Plains of Jarin\">Plains of Jarin</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Sun_Docks\" title=\"Sun Docks\">Sun Docks</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Elite_(quest)\" title=\"Zaishen Elite (quest)\">Zaishen Elite</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">Secondary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ACD;\">Map(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Student Jin Sousuke map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/12/Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg/250px-Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/12/Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg/375px-Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/1/12/Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"377\" data-file-height=\"302\" /></a><br /><small>(Click to enlarge)</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This quest will allow <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a> to join your <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> as a <a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">hero</a>. This quest and <a href=\"/wiki/Student_Jin\" title=\"Student Jin\">Student Jin</a> are mutually exclusive, so once this quest is completed, you won't be able to gain <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Jin\" title=\"Acolyte Jin\">Acolyte Jin</a> as a hero until after the completion of the Nightfall campaign.  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Intermediate_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Student_Jin\" title=\"Student Jin\">Student Jin</a> <i>neither</i> active <i>nor</i> completed</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Zehlon_Reach\" title=\"Zehlon Reach\">Zehlon Reach</a> and bond with <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a> through battle against one of <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Eternal\" title=\"Balthazar&#39;s Eternal\">Balthazar's Eternals</a>.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Field_General_Hayao\" title=\"Field General Hayao\">Field General Hayao</a> for your reward.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>1,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a> joins your party.</li>\n<li>125 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Follow the quest marker to the location in Zehlon Reach (west of <a href=\"/wiki/Astralarium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Astralarium\">Astralarium</a>). At the marker you will find Acolyte Sousuke near Balthazar's Eternal and two <a href=\"/wiki/Ghostly_Griffon\" title=\"Ghostly Griffon\">Ghostly Griffons</a>. Defeat them to complete the quest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 11 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">Ghosts</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Eternal\" title=\"Balthazar&#39;s Eternal\">Balthazar's Eternal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 16 (24) <a href=\"/wiki/Ghostly_Griffon\" title=\"Ghostly Griffon\">Ghostly Griffon</a> (two)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Field General Hayao</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"The <b>Zaishen</b> are sworn blades of <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>, loyal to the end. You have selected <b>Sousuke</b> as your student. It is time to show your pupil the meaning of strength. Together you must defeat one of <b>Balthazar's Eternals</b> in combat. Only through victory in the face of adversity will you be forever bonded with your brethren in arms. You will find the Eternal in Zehlon Reach.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"It's now or never.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"It's never. Or at least not now.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"<b>Acolyte Sousuke</b> is in <b>The <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"Unlike the Student Jin quest, The is capitalized here.\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> Zehlon Reach</b>. He will call forth the <b>Eternal</b> once you arrive.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate_dialogue\">Intermediate dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>At the start of the battle\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Acolyte Sousuke</dt>\n<dd><i>\"Let's see how infinite these Eternals are when they meet my spells head on.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<p>After defeating Balthazar's Eternal and the Ghostly Griffons.\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Acolyte Sousuke</dt>\n<dd><i>\"Ha! I barely broke a sweat. You and I make a good team, yes?\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Field General Hayao</dt>\n<dd><i>\"As his trainer, I think it best you knew something about your pupil. Sousuke is driven by a relentless curiosity and always offering advice, commentary, and wisecracks, but do not let that deceive you. His unique attitude and boundless curiosity are rare in a Zaishen, but he backs it up with a flamboyant, explosive fighting style. Good luck, hero. Go with the blessing of Balthazar.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008164723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 500/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5409/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2103/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.368      1 -total\n 32.68%   13.519      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 31.36%   12.974      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n 10.68%    4.417      1 Template:E\n  7.66%    3.170      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  7.35%    3.040      1 Template:Standard_prerequisites\n  6.81%    2.818      1 Template:Ask\n  6.58%    2.721      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n  6.53%    2.702      1 Template:Yes\n  5.73%    2.372      1 Template:Quest-stub\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:25650-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008164723 and revision id 2627812.\n -->\n</div>"
